    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "DESCRIPTION:\r\n\r\nBARRY AUCTIONEERS & VALUERS are delighted to present this beautifully maintained three-bedroom semi-detached family home to the market, ideally located in one of Cork's most sought-after residential areas.\r\nOriginally designed as a four-bedroom property, the current owners have thoughtfully reconfigured the layout to create a luxurious en-suite and dressing area off the principal bedroom, enhancing both comfort and functionality while providing generous wardrobe space.\r\nThe ground floor offers bright, open-plan living, complemented by a stylish, modern kitchen and dining area. Sliding doors open directly onto the private rear garden, creating an ideal space for both everyday family life and entertaining.\r\nSituated adjacent to Blackrock Castle, this superb home enjoys an exceptional location with an abundance of amenities on its doorstep. A selection of excellent schools, shops, cafés, bars, restaurants, sporting facilities, and regular public transport links to Cork City, CUH, and MTU are all within easy reach. The popular Blackrock Greenway is just moments away, while the vibrant Blackrock Village and picturesque Blackrock Marina are only a short stroll from the property.\r\nThis is a wonderful opportunity to acquire a turnkey family home in a prime location. Early viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this exceptional property has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Hallway - 1.81m x 5.64m \r\nCarpet and radiator, under stairs storage\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 3.56m x 5.35m \r\nGas fire, radiator and timber flooring\n\r\n\r\nFormal Dining Room - 2.79m x 3.66m \r\nTimber flooring and radiator – sliding door to rear of property \n\r\n\r\nKitchen/ Dining Room - 5.05m x 2.59m \r\nWood flooring, radiator, oven, hob grill, fridge and freezer, wash / dryer & dishwasher \r\n\r\nGuest WC - 1.25m x 0.8m \r\n2 Piece, tiled \r\n\r\nLanding - 2.08m x 3.99m \r\nCarpeted \n\r\n\r\nBathroom - 3.29m x 1.79m \r\nThree piece, tiled, bath and electric shower \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.98m x 3.29m \r\nBuilt ins, carpet radiator and ensuite\n\r\n\r\nEnsuite - 2.56m x 0.8m \r\nThree piece, tiled and electric shower \n\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.31m x 3.8m \r\nTimber flooring, rad and built ins\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.84m x 2.71m \r\nTimber flooring, radiator and built ins\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE - \r\nDriveway for 2 cars\nWooden shed\n\r\n\r\n"
